Route104_Text_H15::
	.string "MR. BRINEY'S COTTAGE$"

Route104_Text_H18::
	.string "PRETTY PETAL FLOWER SHOP$"

@ BEGIN PATCH (tools/hoenn_import/patches)
Route104_Text_H0::
    .string "What's at the bottom of the sea?\p"
    .string "Grown-ups say “more sea.”\n"
    .string "I don't believe them.$"

Route104_Text_H1::
    .string "That cottage is MR. BRINEY's. He\n"
    .string "sailed every sea there is, once.\p"
    .string "Now he only sails with his WINGULL,\n"
    .string "PEEKO. He won't go out without it.$"

Route104_Text_H2_0::
    .string "Should I battle you? Should I not?\n"
    .string "…Oh, I'll just do it!$"

Route104_Text_H2_1::
    .string "I should not have.$"

Route104_Text_H2_2::
    .string "Next time I'll decide for myself\n"
    .string "sooner. Then at least it'll be my\l"
    .string "own mistake.$"

Route104_Text_H3::
    .string "Wear a POKéMON down, and put it to\n"
    .string "sleep. Then throw your BALL.\p"
    .string "My sister taught me that.\n"
    .string "She's catching everything.$"

Route104_Text_H4::
    .string "Only wild POKéMON are fair game.\n"
    .string "Taking a TRAINER's is stealing.\p"
    .string "Though I hear some KANTO TRAINER\n"
    .string "can pull it off mid-battle.\l"
    .string "…Not you, surely?$"

Route104_Text_H5::
    .string "Me? I'm not a TRAINER. I just like\n"
    .string "the beach.\p"
    .string "If you don't want a battle, stay\n"
    .string "out of TRAINERS' sight. Everyone\l"
    .string "else here is one.$"

Route104_Text_H6_0::
    .string "I'm a WATER POKéMON expert. Well,\n"
    .string "one POKéMON. Three of it.$"

Route104_Text_H6_1::
    .string "Splashed out. All three.$"

Route104_Text_H6_2::
    .string "One of them will evolve one day.\n"
    .string "I just have to keep believing.$"

Route104_Text_H7::
    .string "My garden gives more BERRIES than\n"
    .string "I can eat these days.\p"
    .string "Here, have one of mine. Hold it,\n"
    .string "and it'll wake a POKéMON up.$"

Route104_Text_H8_0::
    .string "GINA: MIA and I battle together.\n"
    .string "Ready or not!$"

Route104_Text_H8_1::
    .string "GINA: Losing makes me cross!$"

Route104_Text_H8_2::
    .string "GINA: We're going to train loads\n"
    .string "more. Then you'll be sorry!$"

Route104_Text_H9_0::
    .string "MIA: We're twins, so we battle as\n"
    .string "twins.$"

Route104_Text_H9_1::
    .string "MIA: Both of us, at once…$"

Route104_Text_H9_2::
    .string "MIA: SEEDOT and LOTAD will be\n"
    .string "strong like yours one day.$"

Route104_Text_H10_0::
    .string "A battle? Certainly. I can afford\n"
    .string "to lose. I never do, though.$"

Route104_Text_H10_1::
    .string "…I just did.$"

Route104_Text_H10_2::
    .string "Money bought my ZIGZAGOON a very\n"
    .string "nice collar. It didn't buy that.$"

Route104_Text_H11_0::
    .string "How lovely to meet someone new.\n"
    .string "Shall we battle?$"

Route104_Text_H11_1::
    .string "Oh, my goodness!$"

Route104_Text_H11_2::
    .string "Every “hello” ends in a “goodbye,”\n"
    .string "Mother says. I hope ours is a\l"
    .string "“see you again.”$"

Route104_Text_H12_0::
    .string "Look at my footprints! They go all\n"
    .string "the way down the beach!$"

Route104_Text_H12_1::
    .string "Waah! Sand in my shoes!$"

Route104_Text_H12_2::
    .string "The sea keeps rubbing my footprints\n"
    .string "out. I'll just make more.$"

Route104_Text_H13::
    .string "I can spit seeds really fast!\n"
    .string "Watch! Ptoo-ptoo-ptoo!\p"
    .string "Your POKéMON should learn it too.\n"
    .string "Here, it's a TM. I've got spares.$"

Route104_Text_H14_0::
    .string "Behold! A POKéMON of legend!\n"
    .string "Mighty! Majestic! Magnificent!$"

Route104_Text_H14_1::
    .string "Mostly splashing, then.$"

Route104_Text_H14_2::
    .string "MAGIKARP, you're meant to be the\n"
    .string "mighty one. Try, at least.$"

Route104_Text_H16::
    .string "ROUTE 104\n"
    .string "{RIGHT_ARROW} PETALBURG CITY$"

Route104_Text_H17::
    .string "ROUTE 104\n"
    .string "{UP_ARROW} RUSTBORO CITY$"

Route104_Text_H19::
    .string "TRAINER TIPS\p"
    .string "HOENN's TRAINERS often come in\n"
    .string "pairs. In a DOUBLE BATTLE, both\l"
    .string "sides send out two POKéMON.\p"
    .string "The first two in your party go\n"
    .string "first. Line them up with care.$"

Route104_Text_Tm09After::
    .string "TM09 is BULLET SEED. Lots of\n"
    .string "little hits in a row. Ptoo-ptoo!$"

Route104_Text_Tm09BagFull::
    .string "No room in your BAG? Come back.\n"
    .string "I'll keep practising.$"

Route104_Text_ChestoAfter::
    .string "A CHESTO BERRY. If a POKéMON falls\n"
    .string "asleep holding it, it eats it and\l"
    .string "wakes right up.$"

Route104_Text_ChestoBagFull::
    .string "Your BAG's too full, dear. I'll\n"
    .string "save it for you.$"

Route104_Text_WhiteHerbOffer::
    .string "I grew too many of these. I can't\n"
    .string "sell them all, so here.\p"
    .string "It's a WHITE HERB. Your POKéMON\n"
    .string "should hold it.$"

Route104_Text_WhiteHerbAfter::
    .string "If a POKéMON's stats get lowered,\n"
    .string "the WHITE HERB puts them right.\p"
    .string "Once. Then it's used up. Like\n"
    .string "most good things.$"

Route104_Text_WhiteHerbBagFull::
    .string "No space? Never mind, I'll keep it\n"
    .string "fresh for you.$"

Route104_Text_BrineyWhereTo::
    .string "BRINEY: Ahoy, CHAMPION! My boat's\n"
    .string "yours. Where are we headed?$"

Route104_Text_BrineyMenuDewford::
    .string "DEWFORD TOWN$"

Route104_Text_BrineyMenuRoute104::
    .string "ROUTE 104$"

Route104_Text_BrineyMenuRoute109::
    .string "ROUTE 109$"

Route104_Text_BrineyMenuStay::
    .string "STAY HERE$"

Route104_Text_BrineySetSail::
    .string "BRINEY: {STR_VAR_1} it is!\n"
    .string "Hold on to your hat!$"

Route104_Text_BrineyStay::
    .string "BRINEY: Right you are. PEEKO and I\n"
    .string "aren't going anywhere.$"

Route104_Text_BrineyArrived::
    .string "BRINEY: Land ho! Here we are.\p"
    .string "Give me a shout when you want to\n"
    .string "sail on.$"

Route104_Text_WaterRipples::
    .string "The water in the little inlet below\n"
    .string "the pier is rippling strangely…$"

Route104_Text_MudkipFound::
    .string "A MUDKIP is lying in the shallows,\n"
    .string "worn out.\p"
    .string "It must have walked all the way\n"
    .string "from a swamp inland to the sea.\l"
    .string "Its little feet are caked in dust.$"

Route104_Text_MudkipTended::
    .string "{PLAYER} dried it off and gave it a\n"
    .string "SUPER POTION's worth of care.\p"
    .string "MUDKIP shakes itself, looks up…\n"
    .string "and doesn't leave {PLAYER}'s side.$"

Route104_Text_MudkipNoRoom::
    .string "MUDKIP settles into the shallows.\n"
    .string "It'll wait here for you.$"

Route104_Text_WaterAfter::
    .string "Small webbed footprints lead out of\n"
    .string "the mud. Only one set now.$"
@ END PATCH
